# openccu-lite: the init script -> unit table of the systemd products.
#
# One line per /etc/init.d script that a unit in ../system/ wraps: "<script> <unit>".
# Two consumers:
#
#   - board/lite/post-build-systemd.sh renames every script listed here to
#     /etc/init.d/<name>.script and puts /usr/libexec/occu/initscript-wrapper in its place,
#     so a hand-invoked (or addon-invoked) "/etc/init.d/S50lighttpd restart" becomes
#     "systemctl restart lighttpd.service" instead of a daemon started outside its unit;
#   - the wrapper itself reads it to find the unit for the name it was called as.
#
# A unit of "-" means "no unit on this product": start/stop/restart/reload do nothing
# (S07logging is journald's job here, S98StartAddons' run-parts half is the generator's).
# The units' own Exec lines call /etc/init.d/<name>.script directly and never the wrapper.
#
# REVIEW ON EVERY REBASE (docs/upstream-delta.md item 12): a rebase that adds, renames or
# deletes an init script has to add, rename or delete its line here as well - a script that
# is not listed keeps running outside systemd when someone calls it by hand.
#
# The radio chain's scripts (S47InitRFHardware, S48UpdateRFHardware, S49hs485d, S60hs485d,
# S60multimacd, S61rfd, S62HMServer) are not in the image any more (
# board/lite/post-build-systemd.sh removes them; occulited's `radio run` and the direct units
# replaced them), so they have no row: an addon that calls /etc/init.d/S61rfd restart fails, as
# the roadmap item accepts. Re-detection is `systemctl restart occu-init-rf-hardware`.
#
# script                unit
S00watchdog             occu-watchdog-marker.service
S01InitHost             occu-init-host.service
S01InitZRAMSwap         occu-zram-swap.service
S01USBGadgetMode        occu-usb-gadget.service
S02InitRTC              occu-init-rtc.service
S03CheckUserFSResize    occu-userfs-resize.service
S04CheckFactoryReset    occu-factory-reset.service
S05CheckBackupRestore   occu-backup-restore.service
S05seedrng              occu-seedrng.service
S06InitSystem           occu-init-system.service
S07logging              -
S11InitLEDs             -		# merged into occu-leds.service
S13irqbalance           irqbalance.service
S40network              occu-network.service
S46chronyd              chrony.service
S50lighttpd             lighttpd.service
S50sshd                 sshd.service
S55InitAddons           occu-init-addons.service
S98crond                crond.service
S98StartAddons          addons.target
S99SetupLEDs            occu-leds.service
